WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:08.220
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:14.730
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.560
It's my day!

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:27.140
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:34.550
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:41.920
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:49.330
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:55.100
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.240
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:09.750
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:15.890
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:18.950
I just want to walk

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:22.490
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.460
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:35.370
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:41.810
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.080
It's my day!

00:01:57.190 --> 00:01:58.360
Sorry.

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:08.440
If you say it didn't happen,
I believe you.

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:16.280
I believe in you.

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:30.960
"Mine at Last"

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:36.760
Let's go.

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:40.400
Go? Where?

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.070
To my house.

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:49.850
Put this on.

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:21.470
Just a minute! I'm fine.
Put me down.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.270
I'm talking to you!

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:26.910
I'm not putting you down.

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:29.810
You're mine at last.

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:32.550
I'm never letting go.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:34.990
Domyoji...

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:40.220
Besides... You can't go home
like this, can you?

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:55.070
<i>His arms are shaking a little.</i>

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:01.580
<i>The scent of his cologne...
smells heavenly.</i>

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:08.320
<i>I feel like I'm falling under its spell.</i>

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.730
Oh, Master Tsukasa!

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.530
What in the world has happened
to that young lady?

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:24.000
Have a bath drawn and help her bathe.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.540
Yes, sir.

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:27.540
Can you walk?

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.970
This way, please.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.210
I'll be in my room.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:37.850
Are you all right?

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:07.440
What a fabulous bathroom...

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:09.440
Now, let's bathe you.

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:11.710
Um...

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:13.850
Let me have your towel.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:14.970
What?!

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:16.580
Don't be embarrassed.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.490
I'll wash myself!

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:21.680
Oh, dear. The master will scold me.

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:23.020
Never mind, I said!

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:27.560
What's with these rich people?

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:34.000
Ow! That stings!

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.210
I've always wanted to take
a bubble bath...

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:43.840
And in a marble bathtub...

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:48.210
It's like being in a movie.

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:57.520
<i>If you say it didn't happen,
I believe you.</i>

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:02.200
<i>I believe in you.</i>

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:08.170
<i>I couldn't stop my tears
when he said that.</i>

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:14.340
<i>It felt like I was being protected from
all the evils of the world...</i>

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:16.680
<i>...and my knees went weak.</i>

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:23.080
<i>To think that he'd 
rush to my aid like that...</i>

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:25.720
<i>Was it from that day...</i>

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:30.620
<i>that Domyoji seemed to turn
gentle towards me?</i>

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:40.570
<i>Makino...</i>

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:41.330
<i>Huh?</i>

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:50.840
<i>It's nothing...</i>

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:57.380
<i>Everyone thought I was
Domyoji's girlfriend.</i>

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:01.150
<i>And I took advantage of it.</i>

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:04.940
<i>I guess you could say
I used Domyoji.</i>

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:07.940
<i>I believe you.</i>

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:10.330
<i>And yet...</i>

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:15.330
<i>Domyoji said that he believed me.</i>

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:24.460
<i>But...</i>

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:26.610
<i>You're mine at last.</i>

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:29.710
<i>What did he mean by that?</i>

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:32.830
<i>I'm even more confused
about how he feels.</i>

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:41.660
This way, please.

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:44.240
I've brought Miss Tsukushi.

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:45.130
Come in.

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:51.230
I just called your home.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:53.870
I told your mom you were
staying over tonight.

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:58.670
For some reason,
she seemed really happy.

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:01.580
Your hair...

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:06.150
Yeah... my curls turn straight
when they're wet.

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:16.220
Come.

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:19.960
C-come?
What are you planning to do?!

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.470
Stop it!

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:28.500
Please! Be more gentle!

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:29.860
Shut up, will you?

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:33.470
It hurts! Ow! Ow!!

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.960
It burns! Take it easy, will you?!

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:39.250
Shut up! Just keep still.

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:52.530
If you end up with a scar on your face...

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:54.700
I'll take responsibility.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:56.330
Huh?

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:02.170
I'm sorry this happened to you
all because of me.

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:04.470
Forgive me.

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:07.270
<i>Tsukasa...</i>

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:14.010
But, you didn't really do it
with that blond, did you?

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:15.730
<i>What the...?</i>

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:19.350
Idiot! Do you have a 
synapse loose in your brain?

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:21.150
Cinnamon?

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:26.180
I'm not so cheap as
to do something like that...

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:28.810
...with some foreigner
I've just met. Blockhead!

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.170
W-what is it?

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:38.170
Don't tell me you're jealous...

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:40.210
Yeah, right!

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:43.090
I am jealous.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.180
I'm crazy jealous.

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:54.820
Enough that I'd happily kill that guy.

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:17.110
I love you.

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:13.060
I love you.

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:32.750
Domyoji...

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:43.120
W...Wait.

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:52.020
Wait a minute.

00:11:58.770 --> 00:11:59.810
I won't wait.

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:15.990
<i>Perhaps I was hoping for this...
in some place in my heart.</i>

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:26.920
<i>That thought came to my mind
the instant our lips met.</i>

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.310
Why are you blushing?
You're making it hard for me...

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:40.440
You're just as red.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.470
You look like a lobster!

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.150
I'm going to bed.

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:51.790
The maid said she'd have
a room ready for me.

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:53.890
Makino.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:01.730
I'm serious...

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:06.570
Don't brush this off.

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:09.810
Um-hmm...

00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:27.860
<i>I don't believe it...
He loves me?</i>

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:39.270
<i>And I kissed him back.</i>

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:55.850
<i>What am I... What the heck
am I going to do?</i>

00:13:59.260 --> 00:14:01.190
<i>A declaration of war from the F4.</i>

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:10.530
<i>Makiko...</i>

00:14:18.510 --> 00:14:22.410
<i>That's the way it goes
with cheap friendships.</i>

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:39.230
<i>I never thought of you
as a decent human being!</i>

00:14:39.530 --> 00:14:41.530
<i>But I see that you're no
better than vermin!</i>

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:45.000
<i>Just what do you think
you're doing, you jerk?</i>

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:49.270
<i>How dare you hurt
my dear friend!</i>

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:51.670
<i>Say something!</i>

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:53.070
<i>It's because...</i>

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:55.540
<i>Because you don't understand a thing!</i>

00:14:57.510 --> 00:14:58.880
<i>It's all your fault!</i>

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:01.080
<i>Hope you learned your lesson, stupid!</i>

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:52.060
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

00:15:57.300 --> 00:16:02.440
<i>If you say it didn't happen... 
I believe you.</i>

00:16:07.180 --> 00:16:10.680
<i>I believe in you.</i>

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:16.860
<i>Too much has happened
between Domyoji and me.</i>

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:23.700
<i>He may say he loves me,
but I just don't know how to take it.</i>

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:29.300
<i>But...</i>

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:34.210
<i>I didn't turn away from his kiss.</i>

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:40.110
<i>In fact, I think some part of me
was hoping for it.</i>

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:49.250
But... Domyoji and me?
It's weird, no matter what!

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:51.360
My brain's about to explode!

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:06.670
Tell me... What should I do?

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:15.080
You don't know?

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.520
When I need your help most...

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:24.390
What should I do?

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:44.040
<i>Thanks to Domyoji,
I couldn't get much sleep.</i>

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:49.140
<i>But, I must say, this is quite a mansion.</i>

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:55.450
Yes?

00:17:58.150 --> 00:17:59.350
Good morning.

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:01.390
We've brought your breakfast.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:04.100
Good morning.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:12.900
The master asked me to
get you a new uniform.

00:18:13.770 --> 00:18:15.370
What? Really?

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.910
<i>I don't have to get a scolding
from Mom...</i>

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:22.980
I should thank him. 
Where is Domyoji?

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.780
He has already left the house.

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:29.980
Huh? So early?

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:32.720
Yes. He seemed upset...

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:36.390
<i>It's payback time!</i>

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:38.990
He was shouting.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:41.600
Payback?!

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:45.580
Help!

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:46.520
Huh?

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:47.650
I'm sorry!

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:49.140
Look at that!

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.140
What's going on?

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:55.040
Oh, no...

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:56.880
Help!

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:58.540
I'm sorry!

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:04.230
<i>Yikes! He's not fooling around...</i>

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:06.150
<i>He's gone too far!</i>

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:13.930
Quit screaming!

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:17.160
I'll cut your ropes, damn you!

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:21.330
I don't know why you're doing this,
but enough already...

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:23.440
If you cut their ropes, they'll die.

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:26.070
Of course, you're too dumb to realize it.

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:32.710
Listen, you! What are you doing?

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:34.910
You're just in time.

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:39.220
Cut the rope of the guy
you hate the most.

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:42.220
Cut it? But he'll crack his head open
and die.

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:46.650
Help me!

00:19:46.650 --> 00:19:50.330
Hey! He's the one who hit me
with a bat.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.400
Okay. Shall we cut his rope?

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:55.970
Can't hold it...

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:03.160
Something's raining down...

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:05.640
- Eek!
- Filthy!

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:08.210
Uh-oh...

00:20:08.780 --> 00:20:10.510
He's a coward, isn't he?

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:13.450
Pull them up, will you?

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:17.600
Are you satisfied with this?

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:18.690
Oh...

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:25.800
Yeah... That's enough...

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:27.760
I see...

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:36.010
Why are you staring at each other
and blushing?

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:39.420
What's been going on
behind our backs, huh?

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:44.710
<i>It wasn't a dream.</i>

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:50.020
<i>What he said last night...</i>

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:53.430
<i>I love you...</i>

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:57.440
<i>It wasn't... a dream.</i>

00:21:35.530 --> 00:21:36.470
I'm back.

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:38.630
R-Rui!

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:46.310
It's been a while.

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:52.280
Rui... Hanazawa...

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:11.460
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:19.340
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.110 --> 00:22:29.210
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.450 --> 00:22:37.260
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.260 --> 00:22:45.030
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:53.170
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:53.170
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.170 --> 00:23:01.550
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.170 --> 00:23:01.550
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.350 --> 00:23:11.320
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:19.100
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.360 --> 00:23:27.270
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.360 --> 00:23:27.270
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.270 --> 00:23:35.680
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.270 --> 00:23:35.680
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:46.060 --> 00:23:46.890
It can't be!

00:23:47.390 --> 00:23:49.160
Rui Hanazawa is here.

00:23:49.560 --> 00:23:51.590
He's supposed to be in France...

00:23:52.230 --> 00:23:53.760
Is it true you're dating Tsukasa?

00:23:54.560 --> 00:23:57.030
But... Something's strange.

00:23:57.730 --> 00:24:00.500
Rui was always detached
and disinterested.

00:24:00.770 --> 00:24:02.810
Now, he goes around kissing girls
for fun.

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:06.310
Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"Will You Go Out with Me?"

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:09.480
Are you really Rui Hanazawa?
